      non-fatal build warning, easy to miss), and Compose's runtime path parser then throws
      trying to read that placeholder text as path commands. Rounding to integers drops this to
      ~20,700 characters, safely under that limit, with sub-unit error on a 922x1152 viewport
      that's imperceptible at this icon's ~20-25dp display size. If this is ever re-traced from a
      fresh source SVG, re-round it the same way rather than pasting 2-decimal coordinates back in.
